  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi uHerodi inkosi welula izandla ukuba ahluphe abanye bebandla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabulala uJakobe umfowabo kaJohane ngomhedla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esebonile ukuba lokhu kuyabathokozisa abaJuda, waqhubeka wabamba uPetro laye. Kwakuzinsuku zesinkwa esingelamvubelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wambamba, wamfaka entolongweni, wamnikela kwabebutho abalitshumi lesithupha ukuba bamlinde ngabane, eqonde ukumkhuphela ebantwini ngemva kwePhasika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20+EXO.12.21+EXO.12.22+EXO.12.23+EXO.12.24+EXO.12.25+EXO.12.26+EXO.12.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 12:1–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uPetro wagcinwa entolongweni; kodwa ibandla lamkhulekela kakhulu kuNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngobusuku uHerodi abezakumkhupha ngabo, uPetro wayelele phakathi kwabebutho ababili, ebotshiwe ngamaketane amabili, labalindi phambi komnyango babegcine intolongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekufika isithunywa seNkosi, lokukhanya kwakhanya entolongweni. Satshaya uPetro ohlangothini, samvusa sisithi: Sukuma masinyane. Asesiwa amaketane ezandleni zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sathi kuye isithunywa: Gqoka, ufake amanyathelo akho. Wenze njalo. Sathi kuye: Yambatha ingubo yakho, ungilandele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waphuma wasilandela; wayengazi ukuba kuliqiniso okwenziwa yisithunywa, kodwa wayesithi ubona umbono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebedlulile abalindi bokuqala labesibili bafika esangweni lensimbi elokuya emzini, lazivulekela ngokwalo, baphuma, bahamba umgwaqo wamunye; masinyane isithunywa samtshiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UPetro eseqaqabukile wathi: Khathesi sengisazi ngeqiniso ukuthi iNkosi ithumile isithunywa sayo, yangikhulula esandleni sikaHerodi, lakukho konke obekulindelwe yisizwe sabaJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekumkhanyele lokho, wasuka waya endlini kaMariya unina kaJohane othiwa nguMarko, lapho kwakuhlangene khona abanengi bekhuleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eseqoqodile esivalweni sesango, kwasabela intombazana ethiwa nguRoda, yeza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isilizwile ilizwi likaPetro kayivulanga esangweni ngenxa yokuthokoza, kodwa yagijima yabika ukuthi uPetro umi esangweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi kuye: Uyahlanya. Yona yaqinisa ukuthi kunjalo. Bathi: Yisithunywa sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uPetro waqhubeka ukuqoqoda; sebevulile bambona, bamangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebaqhweba ngesandla ukuba bathule, wabalandisela ukuba iNkosi imkhuphe kanjani entolongweni. Wasesithi: Bikelani uJakobe labazalwane. Wasuka waya kwenye indawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekusile, kwaba khona ukunyakazela okukhulu phakathi kwabebutho ngokuthi uPetro uye ngaphi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHerodi esemdingile engamfumani, wabuzisisa abalindi, walaya ukuba babulawe. Wasesuka eJudiya, wehlela eKesariya, wahlala khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHerodi wayebathukuthelele abaseTire labaseSidoni; beza kuye nganhliziyonye; sebevumelene loBlastusi induna yendlu yenkosi, bacela ukuthula, ngoba ilizwe labo lalifunzwa ngelenkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku olumisiweyo uHerodi wambatha ingubo zakhe zobukhosi, wahlala esihlalweni sobukhosi, wenza inkulumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bamemeza bathi: Yilizwi likankulunkulu, kayisilo elomuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masinyane isithunywa seNkosi samtshaya, ngoba kamdumisanga uNkulunkulu; wadliwa zimpethu, wafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ilizwi likaNkulunkulu lakhula, landa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBarnabasi loSawuli babuya bevela eJerusalema sebeqedile umsebenzi wabo, babuya beloJohane othiwa nguMarko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
